#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This dataset shows 10 spheres on the path being previewed by the driver model (both steering and speed).
#
#This uses the output variables generated for the driver model  to locate the point with X-Y coordinates. Because locations are set with X-Y, fields for S-L are all blank.
#
#It uses Symbol Stack variables to specify output variable names used in VS Commands. The easiest way to see the Symbol Stack and VS Commands is by viewing the Parsfile for this dataset.
#
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

